    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling tactical roguelite where strategy is key and every battle matters! Assemble your team of four from a diverse roster of over 25 playable characters, each with unique abilities and playstyles. Face off against the menacing Shadows in  turn-based combat, where every decision could mean victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for a powerful boss encounter that will test your tactics and adaptability. As you progress, discover the map, evolve your heroes, unlock new allies and refine your strategies to push further into the unknown. But beware\u2014hidden within the game are secret battles waiting to challenge even the most skilled players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With deep progression mechanics, challenging encounters, and a constantly evolving roster, every run offers a fresh and exciting experience. Will you master the battlefield and uncover all its secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical turn-based combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15h+ of content</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling tactical roguelite where strategy is key and every battle matters! Assemble your team of four from a diverse roster of over 25 playable characters, each with unique abilities and playstyles. Face off against the menacing Shadows in  turn-based combat, where every decision could mean victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for a powerful boss encounter that will test your tactics and adaptability. As you progress, discover the map, evolve your heroes, unlock new allies and refine your strategies to push further into the unknown. But beware\u2014hidden within the game are secret battles waiting to challenge even the most skilled players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With deep progression mechanics, challenging encounters, and a constantly evolving roster, every run offers a fresh and exciting experience. Will you master the battlefield and uncover all its secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical turn-based combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15h+ of content</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a tactical roguelite adventure where you assemble your team of heroes to battle the Shadow army in turn-based combat. Test your strategy, adaptability and progress through the game to upgrade your characters and unlock new ones, shaping your ultimate squad for the battles ahead!",
